        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Solange der EP-Teiler angeschaltet ist, erhält jedes\nTeam-Pokémon nach einem Sieg Erfahrungspunkte.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Al activar el dispositivo, todos los Pokémon de tu\nequipo ganan Puntos de Experiencia tras los combates,\naunque no salgan a luchar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se attivato, tutti i Pokémon della squadra ricevono\nPunti Esperienza dalla lotta anche se non vi hanno\npartecipato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Turning on this special device will allow all the Pokémon\non your team to receive Exp. Points from battles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "スイッチを　いれると\n手持ちの　ポケモン　すべてが\n経験値を　もらえる　装置。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "打开开关后，\n能让同行的所有宝可梦\n获得经验值的装置。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Al activar el dispositivo, todos los Pokémon de tu\nequipo ganan Puntos de Experiencia tras los combates,\naunque no salgan a luchar.",
